# Financial Dashboard (IFAD)

Implements `FinancialDashboardPRD.pdf`: KPI header, premiums/claims trend chart,
and a sortable Auto + Property Asset Performance Ledger with drill-down.

## Routes

- `/financial-dashboard` - Standard variant (current-system match)
- `/financial-dashboard/bold` - Bold variant (adventurous)
- `/financial-dashboard/original` - Original variant (experimental/out-there)

All three are linked from the "Financial Dashboard" menu in `src/components/Layout.jsx`
(header dropdown + side nav submenu), same pattern as the existing "Business" menu.

## Shared building blocks

- `src/data/financialDashboardData.js` - derives all IFAD figures (Total Owed,
  Total Claimed, Auto/Property split, monthly trend, Asset Ledger, regions)
  from the existing `src/data/businessMockData.js` instead of a second dataset.
  Includes a Gross/Net multiplier (`getPortfolioTotals(basis)`) and
  category/region filtering (`filterLedger`).
- `src/components/financial/TrendChart.jsx` - dependency-free SVG multi-series
  line chart with a toggleable legend. Geometry/scaling is shared; the `theme`
  prop (`standard` | `bold` | `radical`) only changes the visual skin via
  `TrendChart.scss`.
- `src/components/financial/AssetLedgerTable.jsx` - shared sortable Carbon
  `DataTable` for the ledger. Row click navigates to the existing
  `/business/properties/:id` or `/business/fleet/:id` detail pages (reused
  Master-Detail drill-down, no new detail views were created).

## Variant design intent

- **Standard** (`FinancialDashboardStandard.jsx`): mirrors `BusinessDashboard.jsx`
  layout conventions (Grid/Tile, ContentSwitcher, Dropdown) so it matches the
  rest of the app.
- **Bold** (`FinancialDashboardBold.jsx`): same data/components, heavier
  typography, gradient hero banner and KPI cards, still fully theme-token
  driven (light/dark compatible).
- **Original** (`FinancialDashboardOriginal.jsx`): intentionally fixed dark
  "command center" aesthetic (bento grid, glass cards, neon gauge) that does
  not follow the light/dark theme toggle by design - a deliberate one-off
  visual language, not the default app pattern. Uses static (non theme-aware)
  color tokens like `--color-brand-red-60` on purpose.

If any of these routes/components are renamed or removed, update the links in
`src/components/Layout.jsx` accordingly.
